[00:20.25]1. Gracious Jehovah, our strength and our might,
[00:30.04]You are our Savior, in you we delight.
[00:39.84]We are your Witnesses bearing your news,
[00:45.84]Whether men hear or they proudly refuse.
[00:48.84](Chorus)
[00:51.84]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[00:59.61]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[01:05.67]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[01:14.20]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
[01:28.99]2. We who now serve you rejoice in your light;
[01:38.88]Eyes that are opened now see truth and right.
[01:48.48]Searching the Scriptures, we hear your command;
[01:55.10]Making our choice, for your Kingdom we stand.
[01:58.04](Chorus)
[02:00.98]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[02:08.14]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[02:13.58]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[02:21.58]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.
[02:54.62]3. Gladly, O God, we keep doing your will.
[03:02.20]Though Satan mocks us, we’re trusting you still.
[03:12.09]Though he may slay us, oh, help us to be
[03:18.52]Firm to the end for your grand Sov’reignty.
[03:21.46](Chorus)
[03:24.40]Jehovah, our Rock, Our strength and our might,
[03:31.56]Your name we make known Both day and night.
[03:38.60]Glorious Jehovah, Almighty in pow’r,
[03:56.96]You are our hiding place; You are our Tow’r.